                                "sense_id": "a1dcb66d-845e-3f61-bc74-a20133f1b1b2",
                                "text": "Academically, the football team is counter-productive."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "8b32b633-a183-4027-a6c8-54f3ee8a1e7c",
                                "sense_id": "a1dcb66d-845e-3f61-bc74-a20133f1b1b2",
